{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>JingQi Period Tracker 是一款月經週期記錄工具，可記錄每日心情與症狀，適合想輕鬆掌握身體狀況、不欲註冊帳戶的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-226.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>無廣告無帳戶本機儲存</h2>\n<p>App 不設廣告、第三方追蹤或帳戶註冊，紀錄只存於本機並可經 iCloud 同步。它以 Today、Log、Me 三個分頁運作：主頁顯示距下次月經的日數與預計日期，可記錄心情、症狀及備註；Log 以日曆或清單呈現歷史，並可補記過去日期；Me 提供 90 日或全部紀錄的趨勢統計與提醒設定。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-216-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-217-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-218-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-219-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-220-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-221-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：JingQi Period Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/jingqi-period-tracker/id6759287005?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:04:23.796954+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":309,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T22:48:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T03:57:24.889548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T22:57:53.182859+00:00","content_hash":"6f7b7870d80f422e976440470de8c7e811578c1e7c3d4c64009da941119111d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}